{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of MIO: Memories in Orbit. Explore the Vessel, a gigantic spaceship adrift in orbit around a mysterious planet. Play as MIO, an android who wakes up with no memory. Explore the Vessel, fight rogue machines, and unlock new abilities to uncover the secrets of this fallen world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a first glimpse of the experience awaiting you in the full version of MIO: Memories in Orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an early section of the Vessel\u2019s gigantic environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock abilities that enhance your mobility and combat prowess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face corrupted machines and overcome environmental challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the hand-drawn sci-fi environments and uncover the beginning of MIO\u2019s journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a gigantic spaceship adrift in orbit around a mysterious planet. Play as MIO, an android who wakes up with no memory. Find your way into the Vessel, fight rogue machines, and unlock new abilities to uncover the secrets of this fallen world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock more Modifiers and game-changer abilities to go further into the Vessel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a mysterious and inter-connected world, made up of various, colorful ecosystems, with countless secrets and hidden passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and face off a diverse array of friends and foe and formidable guardian bosses.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story behind the fall of the Vessel and the mysteries of MIO\u2019s past.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3496520?t=1749644894","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496520/6adbdd54b3e62de008d8f9e6b7c9a698c3f24994/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749644894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496520/1905dc329065730e060b5ea117a83420e110361e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749644894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496520/1905dc329065730e060b5ea117a83420e110361e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749644894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of MIO: Memories in Orbit. Explore the Vessel, a gigantic spaceship adrift in orbit around a mysterious planet. Play as MIO, an android who wakes up with no memory. Explore the Vessel, fight rogue machines, and unlock new abilities to uncover the secrets of this fallen world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the demo:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a first glimpse of the experience awaiting you in the full version of MIO: Memories in Orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an early section of the Vessel\u2019s gigantic environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock abilities that enhance your mobility and combat prowess.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face corrupted machines and overcome environmental challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the hand-drawn sci-fi environments and uncover the beginning of MIO\u2019s journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the game:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a gigantic spaceship adrift in orbit around a mysterious planet. Play as MIO, an android who wakes up with no memory. Find your way into the Vessel, fight rogue machines, and unlock new abilities to uncover the secrets of this fallen world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock more Modifiers and game-changer abilities to go further into the Vessel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover a mysterious and inter-connected world, made up of various, colorful ecosystems, with countless secrets and hidden passages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and face off a diverse array of friends and foe and formidable guardian bosses.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover the story behind the fall of the Vessel and the mysteries of MIO\u2019s past.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Douze Dixi\u00e8mes"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1672810","name":"MIO: Memories in Orbit"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3496520/674ca12b120ddcae7fed623c0de287b8ecc5dbce/header.jpg?t=1749644894","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025, Douze Dixi\u00e8mes and Focus Entertainment. All rights reserved. MIO: Memories in Orbit, Focus Entertainment and their respective logos are trademarks or registered trademarks in the US and/or other countries. All other trademarks, registered trademarks or their logos belong to their respective owners.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257154846,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto